  "name": "Pillow",
  "description": "Pillow is a comprehensive raster graphics library providing an efficient internal representation and extensive file format support for Python applications. It features a high-performance C-based core, libImaging, which implements low-level pixel manipulation, geometric transformations, and sophisticated color space conversions. The library serves as a critical infrastructure component for image processing, supporting advanced features such as quantization, unsharp masking, and ICC profile management.",
